<title>POLAND: Polish BGZ pre-tax up to PLN 220.2 mln in Jan-Apr.</title>
<headline>Polish BGZ pre-tax up to PLN 220.2 mln in Jan-Apr.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-05-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Polish Bank Gospodarki Zywnosciowej SA preliminary results for four months ending April 30, 1997.</p>
<p>(Figures in millions of zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p> JANUARY -APRIL			    1997	   1996</p>
<p>    profit on banking operations    284.6    vs  141.6</p>
<p>    pre-tax profit			220.2    vs  167.8</p>
<p>NOTE - Full bank name is Bank Gospodarki Zywnosciowej SA.</p>
<p>    interest and similar revenues   205.4    vs  109.7</p>
<p>    revenues from commission	   28.9    vs   28.2</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
